  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Stapled fold binding, offset printed, paper cover embossed with road texture (tarmac and murram).</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Photographs were taken on the streets of Kampala, Uganda and Eugene, Oregon between November 2000 and August 2001"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The title of this book is a mixture of the words Uganda and Oregon, two places that resemble each other in size alone. The book's pages are divided into red and black areas of full-bleed asphalt on top of which are printed small photographs of American pick-up trucks and their Ugandan counterparts - bicycles loaded up with everything from bananas to building materials." --Printed Matter.</subfield>
  </datafield>
